    "text": "<p>Friction force between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and between block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and surface <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> will oppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>",
